# CASM Phase 14 WP89 trusted reference: casmloc3
#
# Independently hand-assembled from the casmloc3 fixture source in
# cmake/GenerateCasmTestFixtures.cmake. NOT produced by CASM. Proves a
# forward @local reference (branch to a @local defined later in the same
# scope) resolves in Pass 2 to the correct displacement.
#
# Source (.ORG $C000, fixed address):
#   | .ORG $C000
#   | MAIN:
#   |     BNE @DONE
#   |     NOP
#   | @DONE:
#   |     NOP
#
# Hand assembly:
#   00 C0    - PRG load-address header
#   D0 01    - BNE @DONE at $C000; @DONE at $C003; $C003 - $C002 = +1 = $01
#   EA       - NOP at $C002
#   EA       - @DONE NOP at $C003
#
# bytes: 6

00 C0
D0 01
EA
EA
